ri":"octo://skills/octo-drive/SKILL.md","summary":"Octo Drive: spaces, folders, upload/download, doc mounts, share links, invites, IM-attachment transfer.","section":"bot-api.md","reference_uri":"octo://skills/octo-drive/bot-api.md","level":"recommended","etag":"1896bcb730a8"}}{"base_url_env":"OCTO_API_BASE_URL","description":"Removes the authenticated principal reaction from the task.","id":"task.reaction.remove","method":"DELETE","patype":"object"}},"required":["data"],"type":"object"},"risk":"high-risk-write","service":"loop","space_header_set":true,"summary":"Remove task reaction"}{"base_url_env":"OCTO_API_BASE_URL","description":"Get local service":"loop","space_header_set":true,"summary":"Get local skill request"}{"id":"docs.attrite","skill":{"name":"octo-docs","resource_uri":"octo://skills/octo-docs/SKILL.md","summary":"Docs, sheets, whiteboards, and PPT: create and govern, members and sharing, comments and versions.","section":"bot-api.md","reference_uri":"octo://skills/octo-docs/bot-api.md","level":"recommended","etag":"831dfd8fc808"}}{"base_url_env,"{"il":{"name":"octo-html","resource_uri":"octo://skills/octo-html/SKILL.md","summary":"HTML docs (octo-doc): create and govern self-contained interactive HTML, versions, drafts, sharing, comments.","level":"recommended","etag":"49247e45188f","hint":"client has no MCP resources support; run `octo-cli skills octo-html` if a shell is available, or proceed with describe_op alone"}}# Bot API operations

Operations a Bot token can call directly. Use `octo-cli schema <operation-id>` (or MCP `get_skill` with intent=describe) for the exact parameters; this page only says what each one is for and what it needs.

## Workspace membership and capabilities

Fleet public-API routes. Adding a member needs the owner or admin workspace role.

Workspace create/update/delete and runtime management (update, delete, archive-and-delete, update/model/local-skill requests and local-skill imports) are intentionally not available through the CLI or MCP.

| Operation | Command | Risk | Purpose |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| `workspace.member.add` | `octo-cli loop workspace member add` | high-risk-write | Add workspace member |
| `capability.install` | `octo-cli loop capability install` | write | Install a capability definition |
